exports[`templates matches the approved Exhibit 1 wording, business variant 1`] = `
"Hello,

We have a mutual client named Whitfield Pictures LLC, who we are helping to finalize their current insurance needs.   This is the first time we’re working with this client, so we are reaching out for more information to finalize our underwriting and verification process.

Please reply to this email and confirm the below:

	•	Have you worked with this client before?
	•	If yes, what is your history with this client?
	•	If no, have you checked any references and/or was this client referred by someone you know and you feel comfortable renting to this customer?
	•	Please provide the total replacement cost value of the equipment (including sales tax) they are renting from you.
	•	Do you require general liability insurance or any other extra coverages for their insurance to be sufficient?

We appreciate your time and look forward to hearing back from you soon.

Thank you!

The Athos Insurance Team
